    {
      "id": "al-vol-surge-insufficient",
      "fn": "eval_alerts",
      "desc": "样本不足：vol_hist 有效样本 4 < 5 → 放量不参与判定（哪怕 volume_today 夸张），不伪造 → 无预警。",
      "tags": ["boundary"],
      "input": {
        "today": "2026-10-29",
        "item": {
